function menuScreen(id){const p=L.find(x=>x[0]===id),items=menus[id];if(!items)return;screen('🍽 '+escapeHTML(p[1]),'Order something · paid on arrival',items.map(([name,price],i)=>action('menu-'+i,name+' · ¥'+price,'')).join(''));items.forEach(([name,price,hunger,fun,energy],i)=>$('menu-'+i).onclick=()=>{if(state.place!==id)return toast('Travel to '+p[1]+' first.');if(state.money<price)return earnScreen('You need ¥'+price+' for '+name.slice(2)+'.');state.money-=price;state.needs.hunger=Math.min(100,state.needs.hunger+hunger);state.needs.fun=Math.min(100,state.needs.fun+(fun||0));state.needs.energy=Math.min(100,state.needs.energy+(energy||0));advance(25);state.xp+=3;finish(name+' · delicious.');menuScreen(id)})}
// Certificates: reaching skill levels earns a certificate and a one-off reward.
function checkCertificates(){if(!state.created)return;state.certs=state.certs||[];for(const [id,name,skill,levelNeeded,reward] of certificates){if(state.certs.includes(id)||(state.skills[skill]||1)<levelNeeded)continue;state.certs.push(id);state.money+=reward;state.logs.unshift('Certificate earned: '+name+' · +¥'+reward);save();setTimeout(()=>notify('🎓 Certificate earned: '+name+' · +¥'+reward.toLocaleString(),skillsScreen),2000)}}
